          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148067,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las funciones necesitan <strong>múltiples parámetros</strong> para trabajar con dos o más piezas de datos, como el nombre de un jugador y una puntuación inicial.</p><p>Ingresa un nombre de jugador y una puntuación para ver una función que toma dos parámetros y los muestra en la pantalla del juego.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0b1020;&#xA;    color: #e7eefc;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 18px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;    cursor: pointer;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    padding: 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;    border: 1px solid #334;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #hudList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    width: 280px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    padding: 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   .panel {&#xA;    width: 320px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    padding: 12px;&#xA;    border: 1px solid #223;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Game HUD Setup&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;hudInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;playerNameInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Player name&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;scoreInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Starting score&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;addHudLine()&quot;&gt;Add to HUD&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;HUD Messages&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=&quot;hudList&quot;&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let number = 0;&#xA;   &#xA;   function addHudLine() {&#xA;    if (number &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;HUD message limit reached&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const playerName = document.getElementById(&quot;playerNameInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     const score = document.getElementById(&quot;scoreInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     let node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Spawned: &quot; + playerName + &quot; | Score: &quot; + score);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;hudList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     number++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148068,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aprendimos cómo crear una función con un solo parámetro como <code>showScore(points)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>showScore</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>points</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148069,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para agregar más parámetros a una función, añadimos una <strong>coma</strong> y el nombre del siguiente parámetro.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points, playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code> seguido de <code>playerName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148070,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pasar varios valores a la función funciona de la misma manera; añadimos una coma <code>,</code> seguida del segundo valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points, playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Riley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code> seguido de <code>\"Riley\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148071,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Después de pasar un segundo valor, podemos usar el nuevo parámetro en nuestra función.</p><p>Muestra el segundo parámetro añadiendo <code>+ playerName</code> dentro de la función.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"points, playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(points + \" /><text value=\"&quot; pts - &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScore(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Riley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>+</code> seguido de <code>playerName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148072,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Los valores se pasan a una función en el <strong>mismo orden</strong> que los parámetros. En este ejemplo, pasa <code>\"Wizard\"</code> como el primer valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"chooseCharacters\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player 1: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player 2: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"chooseCharacters(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Wizard\"</code> seguido de <code>\"Knight\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos agregar tantos parámetros como queramos, siempre que los separemos con comas.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"setLoadout\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"slot1, slot2, slot3\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slot1 + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + slot2 + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + slot3);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setLoadout(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code> seguido de <code>slot3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148074,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué símbolo separa los parámetros de una función?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148075,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuántos parámetros puede tener una función?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tantos como nos gustaría</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uno</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tantos como nos gustaría.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148076,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo pasamos valores a una función con múltiples parámetros?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Los valores y los parámetros tienen que estar en el mismo orden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Podemos pasar los valores en cualquier orden</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Los valores y los parámetros tienen que estar en el mismo orden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148077,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué valor se muestra al final en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showLoot\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showLoot(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Gem</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Gold</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>Gem</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148078,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"craft\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = craft(\" /><text value=\"&quot;iron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;+1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ironsword+1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+1swordiron</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>ironsword+1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148079,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica el segundo parámetro para esta función.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;7&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"createSaveName\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName, level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName + level + \" /><text value=\"&quot;-save&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" saveFile = createSaveName(\" /><text value=\"&quot;jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;7&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(saveFile);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>level</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148080,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código el símbolo correcto para separar los dos parámetros.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addBuff\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"buff, stat\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" buff + stat;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boosted = addBuff(\" /><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;speed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boosted);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148081,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pasa los valores para que <code>Goblin</code> se muestre al final.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"133\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showTargets\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showTargets(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"Dragon\"</code> seguido de <code>,</code> y finalmente <code>\"Goblin\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148082,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega los parámetros para que el código muestre <code>Level1BossFight</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"mix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second, third\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first + second + third);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = mix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>first</code> seguido de <code>,</code> y luego <code>second</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
